sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Member as Member
    participant Community as WaterballCommunity
    participant ChatRoom as ChatRoom
    participant Forum as Forum
    participant Broadcast as Broadcast
    participant Bot as Bot
    participant Game as KnowledgeKingGame
    participant Question as Question
    participant Recording as RecordingSession

    Note over Client,Bot: 場景一：正常狀態下的聊天輪播回覆
    Client->>Member: sendMessage(chatRoom, content, tags)
    Member->>ChatRoom: postMessage(message)
    ChatRoom->>Bot: onMessageReceived(message)
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage(輪播內容, tags)
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(replyMessage)

    Note over Client,Game: 場景二：管理員下達 king 指令，啟動知識王
    Client->>Member: sendMessage(chatRoom, "king", ["bot"])
    Member->>ChatRoom: postMessage(message)
    ChatRoom->>Bot: onMessageReceived(message)
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage(輪播內容, tags)
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(replyMessage)
    Note right of Bot: 判斷權限/額度通過 -> 轉移至 KnowledgeKing 狀態
    Bot->>Game: getCurrentQuestion()
    Game-->>Bot: Question
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage(題目內容, [])
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(questionMessage)

    Note over Client,Game: 場景三：成員答題與結算
    Client->>Member: sendMessage(chatRoom, answer, ["bot"])
    Member->>ChatRoom: postMessage(message)
    ChatRoom->>Bot: onMessageReceived(message)
    Bot->>Game: submitAnswer(memberId, answer)
    Game->>Question: isCorrect(answer)
    Question-->>Game: true
    Game-->>Bot: true (答對，計分並推進題目)
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage("Congrats! you got the answer!", [memberId])
    Bot->>Game: isFinished()
    Game-->>Bot: true
    Bot->>Game: getWinner()
    Game-->>Bot: winnerId 或 "Tie!"
    Bot->>Broadcast: isBroadcasting()
    Broadcast-->>Bot: false
    Bot->>Bot: broadcastVoice(結果內容)
    Bot->>Broadcast: start("bot")
    Bot->>Broadcast: speak(voiceMessage)
    Bot->>Broadcast: stop("bot")
    Note right of Bot: 20 秒後 (onTimeElapsed) 轉移回 Normal 狀態

    Note over Client,Recording: 場景四：錄音狀態
    Client->>Member: sendMessage(chatRoom, "record", ["bot"])
    Member->>ChatRoom: postMessage(message)
    ChatRoom->>Bot: onMessageReceived(message)
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage(輪播內容, tags)
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(replyMessage)
    Note right of Bot: 轉移至 Record 狀態 (Waiting)

    Client->>Member: startBroadcast(broadcast)
    Member->>Broadcast: start(speakerId)
    Broadcast->>Bot: onBroadcastStarted(speakerId)
    Note right of Bot: 轉移至 Recording 子狀態

    Client->>Member: speak(broadcast, content)
    Member->>Broadcast: speak(voiceMessage)
    Broadcast->>Bot: onVoiceSpoken(voiceMessage)
    Bot->>Recording: addVoice(voiceMessage)

    Client->>Member: stopBroadcast(broadcast)
    Member->>Broadcast: stop(speakerId)
    Broadcast->>Bot: onBroadcastStopped(speakerId)
    Bot->>Recording: generateReplay()
    Recording-->>Bot: "[Record Replay] ..."
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage(replayText, [recorderId])
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(replyMessage)

    Client->>Member: sendMessage(chatRoom, "stop-recording", ["bot"])
    Member->>ChatRoom: postMessage(message)
    ChatRoom->>Bot: onMessageReceived(message)
    Bot->>Recording: generateReplay()
    Recording-->>Bot: "[Record Replay] ..." (若有錄到內容)
    Bot->>Bot: replyChatMessage(replayText, [recorderId])
    Note right of Bot: 轉移回 Normal 狀態

    Note over Client,Forum: 場景五：論壇貼文互動
    Client->>Member: publishPost(forum, title, content, tags)
    Member->>Forum: createPost(post)
    Forum->>Bot: onPostPublished(post)
    Bot->>Community: getOnlineCount()
    Community-->>Bot: 在線人數
    Bot->>Bot: commentPost(postId, "Nice post", [authorId])
    Bot->>Forum: addComment(postId, comment)
    Forum->>Post: addComment(comment)
